   "reason": "The capture reads the label as therapies using stem cells to treat disease, which includes HSCT, and D37 counts earlier use. AutoHCT reached 27.4% of US myeloma patients diagnosed 2011-2016 (PMC11624524), above 5%. Both graders excluded HSCT on an unstated forward-looking reading and said it would otherwise be a hit."
