   "graderA": "miss",
   "graderB": "partial",
   "reason": "CRISPR editing of embryos (He Jiankui, 2018) was criminalised and abandoned. But Newcastle has held a clinical licence for mitochondrial donation by pronuclear transfer since 2017, inside the NHS pathway though framed as a research study, and eight babies were reported in 2025. Licensed, tiny-scale use within the window = D37 partial. A misses this path; a strict nuclear-editing reading would give miss, which is why this call is less certain."
  },
